// DetailString :
"P518282753" "You found this note on a Tsoo gangster. It reads:<br><br>'R Y N P S   K N G S E   Q S R J T   P D P J I   R C J H L   S I X J D   R J Q Y A   P J N I K   A I N N P   A I K S P   N J L N P   S R A I K   S R 9 7 C   S L S C A   R X V N S   Q F R Y S   R H J P N   Q X I R Y   N Q A Z N   P Q E N S   O O N O Q   J V N C S   I A I C P   N S Q N L   P J O T C   R A J I H   P L J'"

