// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P492831799" "You're right, this drug is packaged exactly like Superadine. But it isn't. It's Rage.<br><br>The Tsoo have been manufacturing Rage lately; they're hoping it will become the new drug of choice. Let me tell you, you don't want to mix the two. It would cause a massive chemical imbalance in the brain, turning you into an berserk killing machine. <br><br>Oh, I almost forgot; {ContactName} called me. Apparently Vitaly Cherenko wants a look at some artifact you recovered from the Outcasts. {ContactName} said you should get it to him without delay."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound3_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3312518597" "Take artifact to Vitaly Cherenko"
